OL,3,GNEWSAHospital staff facing verbal abuse
OL,4,A'on daily basis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who runs an emergency
OL,7,Fdepartment says hospital staff are
OL,8,Ffacing verbal abuse "on a daily basis".
OL,10,FSarah McKay, who works as a senior
OL,11,Fsister on the emergency department at
OL,12,Fthe John Radcliffe Hospital, said staff
OL,13,Fhave seen an increase in racial, sexual
OL,14,Fand homophobic abuse, as well as
OL,15,Fphysical assaults.
OL,17,FIt comes as Oxford University Hospitals
OL,18,FNHS Foundation Trust (OUH) has
OL,19,Fpartnered with Thames Valley Police to
OL,20,Fbring a scheme known as Operation
OL,21,FCavell to its hospitals across the
OL,22,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
