OL,3,GNEWSAHospital staff facing verbal abuse
OL,4,A'on daily basis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe campaign will see the local NHS
OL,7,FTrust, police force and the Crown
OL,8,FProsecution Service come together to
OL,9,F"strengthen protections for NHS staff,
OL,10,Fimprove conviction rates and support
OL,11,Fvictims".
